 <h3><u>Chacha mai aapki turbat</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye chacha abbas..(3)<br> Haan..<br> arey jab dafn karne aaye, tane paash paash ko<br> abid pukare dekh ke ghazi ki laash ko<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu<br> sakina ab bhi hai pyaasi batane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>sakina ab bhi hai pyaasi batane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Batau kaise chacha kya guzar gayi hum par<br> har ek shehr mein maare gaye hame patthar<br> thi maaein phupiya mere saath aye ali ke pisar<br> ye saari zulm ke qisse sunane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Haram ko chodke kufe se aa raha hu chacha<br> bata gay hai tumhari wasiyatein baba<br> wahi ho qabr chida tha jaha'n pe mashkiza<br> kiya tha sheh se jo waada nibhane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Hai teen roz se laashe pe dhoop ka saaya<br> ye haal dekhke rota hai khoon dil mera<br> ghareeb hu mai kafan tumko de nahi sakta<br> haye tumhari laash ke tukde uthane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Sakina raah mein naake se gir gayi thi abhi<br> wahi hai taaza riwayat kamar pe likkhi hui<br> hai jaari khoon jo is waqt aydiyo'n se meri<br> laee'n se khake abhi taaziyane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Tumhare saamne aati hai sharm kehte hue<br> ye baat karta bhala kaise saamne unke<br> abhi hai door yaha se bani asad wale<br> haye, phuphi ki chinn gayi chadar batane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. La'ee ne bachhi ke gauhar ko aise cheena tha<br> giri zamee'n pe sakina mai khoon rota tha<br> wo jis zameen pe kaanto'n se khoon tapka tha<br> wo khaak rakhne tumhare sirhane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Baghair inke tum utre the zeen se kaise<br> haram to lut gaye ye baazu kat gaye jab se<br> pade the door ye laashe se aapke kabse<br> kate ye baazu badan se milane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Banake qabr takallum wo bola ro ro kar<br> yaha'n pe aayenge ab zaereen shaam o sahar<br> jale khayam ki rakh kar lahad pe khaak magar<br> haye, mai pehla farsh azaa ka bichane aaya hu<br> chacha mai aapki turbat banane aaya hu..(2)</p> 
